## 4. Import contracts

Machine checking of architectural seams — `.importlinter` (gate step `lint-imports`).
A contract violation cannot be "explained away with a comment": it is a sign of a wrongly drawn seam.

<PROJECT>'s current contracts — see `.importlinter`. In brief:

- <layers views → services → models, no reverse>
- <domains are independent of each other>
- <a pure calculation layer without a web framework>

